/api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094","id":742873029,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc0Mjg3MzAyOQ==","user":{"login":"alexshtin","id":2232524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzI1MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2232524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin","html_url":"https://github.com/alexshtin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-12-10T23:49:14Z","updated_at":"2020-12-10T23:49:14Z","body":"No, it was just pure `nil` but when `nil` is assigned to typed param which then passed to `interface{}` param it becomes interface with type and `nil` value. Similar to: https://play.golang.org/p/sDJBWQweAYw\r\n\r\nActually I found only case in our code and it is fixed here: https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/1067 (`wfClient` is gRPC generated client. Btw, we use [gogo](https://github.com/gogo/protobuf), but I think it doesn't matter as it calls standart `grpc` lib anyway).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/742873029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/747195369","html_ur